    "title": "Crews battle 2-alarm apartment fire in Towson - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Montcalmo ,\n5 hours ago TOWSON, MD—Crews are on the scene of an apartment fire in the Towson area.\nAt around 6:20 p.m. on Wednesday, May 13, units responded to a fire at the Versailles Apartments, located in the 100 block of Versailles Circle.\nA second alarm has been sounded and the Red Cross is en route.\nNo injuries have been reported and the cause of the blaze is under investigation.\nPhoto via Baltimore County Fire Department 1",
